{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24293","headline":"咏老赠梦得 · 白居易","name":"咏老赠梦得","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"与君俱老也，自问老何如。\n眼涩夜先卧，头慵朝未梳。\n有时扶杖出，尽日闭门居。\n嬾照新磨镜，休看小字书。\n情於故人重，迹共少年疎。\n唯是闲谈兴，相逢尚有余。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24293.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24293","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}